            sqlQuery:
                ```sql
                select 1 /*T11151510*/
                  from dual
                  where (nvl(to_number(:P322_JUROS, '999G999G999G990D00'),0)  + nvl(to_number(:P322_TAXA, '999G999G999G990D00'),0) + nvl(to_number(:P322_ACRESCIMO, '999G999G999G990D00'),0)) > 0
                    and nvl(to_number(:P322_DESCONTO, '999G999G999G990D00'),0) > (nvl(to_number(:P322_JUROS, '999G999G999G990D00'),0)  + nvl(to_number(:P322_TAXA, '999G999G999G990D00'),0) + nvl(to_number(:P322_ACRESCIMO, '999G999G999G990D00'),0))
